<TabularMCQGrader id="tmf_synth_sort_grader">
<TabularMCQ id="tmf_synth_sort_grid">
cols:
  - "19th-century temperance movement"
  - "Today's sober-curious movement"
rows:
  - "Focused on the individual's own health and self-optimization|s_health[Today's sober-curious movement]"
  - "Grew out of religious revival and the campaign for women's rights|s_revival[19th-century temperance movement]"
  - "Framed as authenticity, self-care, and a personal 'freedom to choose'|s_auth[Today's sober-curious movement]"
  - "Used images like 'The Drunkard's Progress' to warn of moral ruin|s_litho[19th-century temperance movement]"
  - "Framed as protecting the home, the family, and the nation|s_protect[19th-century temperance movement]"
</TabularMCQ>
</TabularMCQGrader>
